  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38a3ec399f3e75e622606ac4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您还记得母亲的跑姿呢。\n很荣幸。为了不输给她，我会更加精进的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3835e0533f116c2060c11bf7f1af394933eea0dd93be2d9bc6c4c26a37b823c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1287"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cb78b2154b2aa62c305030",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向今天来到现场观看的家人们。\n还有与我一同走来的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc402fcab1d24938e8ba873959142b66c9a76fc7c45a334268ae720d85893f90",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1288"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ca6881134c6e81d5e792ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您还记得母亲的跑姿呢。\n很荣幸。为了不输给她，我会更加精进的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3835e0533f116c2060c11bf7f1af394933eea0dd93be2d9bc6c4c26a37b823c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bca2248db498632158a5e77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开心最重要吧☆\\n看看报纸让心情嗨起来也不错☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a929292271283005a247cd941e01c5d8502f719f7dfb8c81f933628931d587",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c779189a00c9340a3049b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，哈哈哈……算是我的习惯吧。\n绝对不是得意忘形了哦！　绝对不是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0983087fe27fa8d320b85cea87249b5ba65c73d00fb21cde22f6ccb3057bb2ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1290"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a834fa23c8532b70881e14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……有的。但是，我不会说出来。\n如果不做到能被对方意识到的程度可不行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "011992d8932830b273895b519d52dd531e2128aa5d1a730cc5e5b8a2555e9226",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a00cc8477d15465228e17dad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……心理训练吧。我经常\n和极峰小姐交换情报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba220fbdd5a4f8b6f37136d29d172a0b3e1628bcdce96738efb45fd12487a4b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ea2dfdbe61f8edd255c9d22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收到了高尚骏逸小姐和优秀素质小姐发来的祝贺\nLANE消息……嗯。我会继续努力的，下一次也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f11028aab632e3f957bc46c14ccdf07cae0fb1d4b97971594924a53b20049e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1293"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8904aa424b85aa3e9d1aaa48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你。但是……还不够。\n——为了追上。必须要逼自己一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f142fd42c1f65e89edd3ed715b043124212c2e1fbfdf3423da72327d604c06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1294"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62533cbebd3032cec677e7f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……心理训练吧。我经常\n和极峰小姐交换情报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba220fbdd5a4f8b6f37136d29d172a0b3e1628bcdce96738efb45fd12487a4b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1295"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16d6e025b341d512de231049",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收到了高尚骏逸小姐和优秀素质小姐发来的祝贺\nLANE消息……嗯。我会继续努力的，下一次也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f11028aab632e3f957bc46c14ccdf07cae0fb1d4b97971594924a53b20049e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1296"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:483d5e2bd6a2e48131e36dc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你。但是……还不够。\n——为了追上。必须要逼自己一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f142fd42c1f65e89edd3ed715b043124212c2e1fbfdf3423da72327d604c06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e5e723464eb6e78047b65d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说的也是呢……今天的话，苹果……\n苹果派的话！　应该能吃一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a686b4a9ea98eb48b756d1e1cfd098b2290563d56841dda8cd926e67efa4269",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a74fe28ae34486c0547badc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……老实说，虽然也有过想要放弃的时候，\n但能坚持相信真是太好了。相信我积累下来的努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f427bea25ba7deacef0fbde04d80e0d3a17fbe813df58bf54bf67b9e0ccd9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8de41c74b8d712b57250b67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多亏平常有做好健康管理所以还活跳跳的！\\n像昨天也做了大腿骨伸展操呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0afa6da0f6a7ac2d3bd6ee307cc72d958ddf69e10be5e9989ae38f50ccb33a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0d140adc8dbad50dce3745",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，最后直线的表现好像大受欢迎耶！\\n啊哈哈哈哈！咳咳，不能呼吸了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7de552251624dbc371c52f4b074a88d4fb043c3aa50aaac8371a06a57ce2ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ad63bd30ea413b3e7b21c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说的也是呢……今天的话，苹果……\n苹果派的话！　应该能吃一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a686b4a9ea98eb48b756d1e1cfd098b2290563d56841dda8cd926e67efa4269",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76d480f94681731cf6cbe390",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……老实说，虽然也有过想要放弃的时候，\n但能坚持相信真是太好了。相信我积累下来的努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f427bea25ba7deacef0fbde04d80e0d3a17fbe813df58bf54bf67b9e0ccd9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fffbda6d97873bcb3a3ed3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的。她们总是一次不落地来为我加油……\n有了她们的支持才有了今天的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1567eab37b767dad693850af74a57f7b2c0b4aead8e2004806a5573c50095f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e8fb4e7245003faa67f8d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯。刚开始的时候特别辛苦。经常因为\n做饭做得太多而分发给附近的邻居呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "488c9973fa15094a920d001c83acb35370677509a10f063c61e83693a82ac5b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e52538325a2513a0527620",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然只是一些基础……因为我小时候，也是\n船桥特雷森的前辈教我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989f31688a110df21361bb63f227410e42c3430919009d562e6ba6eee4d9c295",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef4cb1cf504fae45b69449c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为是无意识的所以没什么特别的……啊，\n倒是一直有在注意，要展现出不愧对船桥代表之名的身姿呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e167950d0a022def73044edd8f1b7b0e3cc551f433cac51c667860613e6e6ff7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f0fa855cdf1c672cf344c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "打算和家人还有老家的朋友们通个话……。\n这对我来说，是比什么都重要的活力源泉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26ca8dcd7ed9c0efa40751b07dfcf6b7fe6e720e9229f57a2d318a455aea296",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27fbb9b636a4bbbbcb90736c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然只是一些基础……因为我小时候，也是\n船桥特雷森的前辈教我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989f31688a110df21361bb63f227410e42c3430919009d562e6ba6eee4d9c295",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:649f7cea8e6a16e9384439dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为是无意识的所以没什么特别的……啊，\n倒是一直有在注意，要展现出不愧对船桥代表之名的身姿呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e167950d0a022def73044edd8f1b7b0e3cc551f433cac51c667860613e6e6ff7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a2149cde2215c2aca10d39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "打算和家人还有老家的朋友们通个话……。\n这对我来说，是比什么都重要的活力源泉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26ca8dcd7ed9c0efa40751b07dfcf6b7fe6e720e9229f57a2d318a455aea296",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3719beb393bd2b260160c935",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为涡轮很强！！\\n啊，还有还有，绝不放弃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27028e0899e53ff76106f05e4e6c4b5db8b8e82add3fc059cca1551a16218440",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2f7a67437261575b7d0c627",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的……那些声音给了我力量。这是\n不仅是我，而是大家一起赢下的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e53d2c427b75c47108629b651bdbea1516257f271343daf4f915e076528e0e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9255001922569bb4bed68e19",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是船桥产的梨汁哦！　我们两个人决定了绝对\n要用这个。为了『敬船桥一杯』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f4efe18cd37e5077407e667061019a4047077071f2fe9d0f128d85d4889645",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83108405d6e5c350ffd5a25b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的……那些声音给了我力量。这是\n不仅是我，而是大家一起赢下的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e53d2c427b75c47108629b651bdbea1516257f271343daf4f915e076528e0e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2879217b4e481125a33d2669",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是船桥产的梨汁哦！　我们两个人决定了绝对\n要用这个。为了『敬船桥一杯』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f4efe18cd37e5077407e667061019a4047077071f2fe9d0f128d85d4889645",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b15423a3eb88448f6ef808",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真真真的是吗！？　太……咳咳！\n嘛，既然以会长为目标，不被仰慕可不行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f94f2718d70c7cf3ed264ff783296275f282cbfa26d36fdc2ed5a3372fc16c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f05e1d48de1cc1429b73d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把被褥换成和会长一样的了！　一想到会长也\n盖着一样的被子，我就能安然入睡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbbad1807321fef5af3602a025b92e9d6152454868bd0ac7ecd07d54a8cd5afa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee3c872c96462b72b5d15da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是想要奔跑的心情！　唯独这件事，\n我一直、一——直在心里想着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6815fd57904d057b669747632269c187cd3d33f911f0604ab0f1d53bd5d6f5a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdda70342a698e8a48f3b399",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如您所见！　完全没问题咳、咳咳！\n刚、刚才只是，不小心用力过猛了，咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f41dd7869d3d079c93e0f94c900ce3cd8050cd6b946071b0ab1697a7e338f28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98a492ea0f71cfc697b2ee0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊——等等！　那明明是我想要\n说的！？　本来该是由我来帅气地收尾的——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac463095322ff76ab98fc8d53149446d1a0853bbffd579366dc562bc311dba9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c127a82f7f4b4150291e6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是想要奔跑的心情！　唯独这件事，\n我一直、一——直在心里想着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6815fd57904d057b669747632269c187cd3d33f911f0604ab0f1d53bd5d6f5a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6807d4d5806e45973f559346",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "涡轮全开！轰隆隆地拼命往前冲！\\n然后突破极限！砰！穿过终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90f98fcae5fc9fcc59c5f7a08efdc110fa5a385a0dedf83b2cc5d545d6bc5253",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e27ca665525960c0a9b0d5a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如您所见！　完全没问题咳、咳咳！\n刚、刚才只是，不小心用力过猛了，咳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f41dd7869d3d079c93e0f94c900ce3cd8050cd6b946071b0ab1697a7e338f28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:691770be05204ab282c438f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊——等等！　那明明是我想要\n说的！？　本来该是由我来帅气地收尾的——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac463095322ff76ab98fc8d53149446d1a0853bbffd579366dc562bc311dba9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7350ce3c6d75c5385404ca0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好勒，来了！　……嗯嗯，正是——\n『云外苍天』。这个，请务必写上去哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1cf0691ae15fbc0bfc2cf8abf4152b2a3efd2d3278dfb951a6ab721c7c3778",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2fcf153cb40307987fe369",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志是，『很强』的。\n给所有这样相信着我的人！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b50f4ed31f9b42fd6f8d15b3c709f4578f65b74aeaf8e7aeeb06a182a34f6d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbddbb1872fda6c9261109b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好勒，来了！　……嗯嗯，正是——\n『云外苍天』。这个，请务必写上去哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1cf0691ae15fbc0bfc2cf8abf4152b2a3efd2d3278dfb951a6ab721c7c3778",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4549d112b4694d5416918495",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志是，『很强』的。\n给所有这样相信着我的人！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b50f4ed31f9b42fd6f8d15b3c709f4578f65b74aeaf8e7aeeb06a182a34f6d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370653e94fe24f201bacd181",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是愚蠢至极。\n无论何时，一切，尽在我的掌握之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "675a72bcd470de1e8ab09272618066fbf1aa336b95192dd4b55daee8d3edb6c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08d6cb97d679d7625ec06160",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……倒也算愉快。\n——为我的霸道，增色不少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff338bfd8c704ab2cb8e8fa974904c3dbdc5b2402bf1d6532fa5b40dd0155023",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cffdcf5853f39205cfec83f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去问姐姐大人。大多时候，我们都是一起吃饭的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a2e151ead7e9b8f08635b6e472e935045cd33a7a434be6dc0b889fdaf2d657",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a621186e958a99ca485abbd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "（兴致高昂的黄金巨匠小姐，\n跑离了优胜者展台前）",
      "source_fingerprint": "409605a33520f4508c5cb99bf3cd0f7e06ca1ba7fac1e07c63b2fc93b1e9999a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:289f9ec66574e91f6af7bbeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我期许自己一定要去响应那些期待的声音。\\n所以请大家要继续关注我今后的表现♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08310e1a33edb4c0f4c66b9b4261ca5f3b6924dd4cdb407e142c61311efacfcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30062a6c882ee787a1885829",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "值得称赞的态度。必须用王者的奔跑，\n来引导他们才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81308f97ad3e70037554d7d5d2d07873258a5e543dc88466dfbaf5735a59922a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abfc34c328f8e33b11f97439",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去问姐姐大人。大多时候，我们都是一起吃饭的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a2e151ead7e9b8f08635b6e472e935045cd33a7a434be6dc0b889fdaf2d657",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
