      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d46b3cba9880b9874134589",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "――――哼。\n去慰劳一下他吧。那家伙，也算是做得不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1bcff73bbc087200d5cac245ad4b0e20c281ca9fad52a926c43c7cfd7c49bc3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a16b802f9954dcda3659d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的训练员！　这是我的规矩！\n记者小姐你没看到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6735460de555b8b0ccc930c7268f7aae9fc20123e1e390ff20e1b100e34b39e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6401ee5c9c55a6d76737ea5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "早上沙拉的新鲜度吧\n因为『美好的一天从美好的沙拉开始』嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d848d9bcc282227bc5f3dd5926e2f675dc6e2bfce954ab04f28f1156ed644577",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:212837df7518ae7830aa7e2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为有里见家的各位为我声援……\\n所以我希望自己能带回优异的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9cdf74040d11c97fe0612742c64477d2cccebde56035aeb955f9022d807c562",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792b761fe27ab7eb00f03920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给最喜欢的妈妈！\n告诉她『英里果然是最强的哦！』♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7849b051a4267d4b623ac5b18dd3913aec945977c63ff7b04a5c8c610ec062",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a7c64078e80d5ec65e073e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，记者小姐你看到了吗？　欸嘿嘿♪\n喜悦溢出了5英里那么多，一时没忍住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e400f55f942fc4cbf14c4910deefeef7a398324eecd610f26c76b5068bdfa3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c49d15fafc04eed987c17db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎？　嗯……果然还是因为英里最强，\n而我是英里最强！　的原因吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a70b8ff4fac8a43a4702096587b78b6792988fc8bbcf3232a8e8f45a00cd6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:085a58905be0bb5d5da300a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给最喜欢的妈妈！\n告诉她『英里果然是最强的哦！』♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7849b051a4267d4b623ac5b18dd3913aec945977c63ff7b04a5c8c610ec062",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93aa4a17dc293856ee50e027",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，记者小姐你看到了吗？　欸嘿嘿♪\n喜悦溢出了5英里那么多，一时没忍住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e400f55f942fc4cbf14c4910deefeef7a398324eecd610f26c76b5068bdfa3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0002fd60081da0371ec33011",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎？　嗯……果然还是因为英里最强，\n而我是英里最强！　的原因吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a70b8ff4fac8a43a4702096587b78b6792988fc8bbcf3232a8e8f45a00cd6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7434327778a315e85cf1780",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "2万5千英里——不对，无量大数英里！\n高兴到能用英里绕宇宙一圈了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91aa066af07e1ac7f49991e3455c4bac2e51b4e51b2fc8c9414bfc19598bb467",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec7878d668c3e91b27b8025",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿，『放声欢呼的话理所当然！』\n……达成了，我的规矩♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db34e57bd4e32f814db0129db2d7032088cb9abfb1ae9e033e2480678752b08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8679bbdc75b9ce163eabe017",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "2万5千英里——不对，无量大数英里！\n高兴到能用英里绕宇宙一圈了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91aa066af07e1ac7f49991e3455c4bac2e51b4e51b2fc8c9414bfc19598bb467",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1348"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d20ddd4689183d0de21115ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿，『放声欢呼的话理所当然！』\n……达成了，我的规矩♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db34e57bd4e32f814db0129db2d7032088cb9abfb1ae9e033e2480678752b08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1349"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c980277b3c3cd0515e5f73a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我没办法放着有困难的人不管……\\n我希望自己能兼顾竞赛和助人之心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5be6f51e529ee7ae3230134c11e293e9e474a879b68df7a6ee9679d1117237f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0969728f96ef9c62490adeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，深切地体会到了一件事……\n赢了之后的快乐水真好喝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff7f893d304c6e36e32880822f38a3bc9fed29867cd97f9cda9627a696549ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1350"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c411b6c748bf2735a0f558f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不论是谁都举起酒杯吧。\n为经历了精彩战斗的诸位，干杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a15199d7ec4cd8d9717ac2bab89c275085dffd74c0524cb6ac614ef18b23d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3338aaee98cedde8beeba74b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是自然！　到了本大将这种级别，\n就算在暴风雨中也能明镜止水，轻而易举。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49974f05428e8cfd291277ec6eb70414181fa329a82cce5ed8d5390335b14a56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d25cb27cb2ad64f308d27bd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，给本大将献上了相当不错的上策呢。\n咕咕咕，偶尔夸奖一下他吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd09c96df3e6b4af688986a028f210e2a4ad745bfda9e196f72e75f7d36a55f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bd64964387001cb542e998",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人事已尽。剩下的就像本大将一样\n受天道宠爱便可。喵哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c2955a65370de78edd5d048aae19f97b7ff0b2109ad8659e4a85f082009ffb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908c447842043bc5a55e5bc2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是自然！　到了本大将这种级别，\n就算在暴风雨中也能明镜止水，轻而易举。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49974f05428e8cfd291277ec6eb70414181fa329a82cce5ed8d5390335b14a56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644e9496ab79cc6641a8be6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，给本大将献上了相当不错的上策呢。\n咕咕咕，偶尔夸奖一下他吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd09c96df3e6b4af688986a028f210e2a4ad745bfda9e196f72e75f7d36a55f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc98745516b58537386b40c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人事已尽。剩下的就像本大将一样\n受天道宠爱便可。喵哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c2955a65370de78edd5d048aae19f97b7ff0b2109ad8659e4a85f082009ffb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345471d47a20a948615e6d66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是天下，但这里不需要。\n本大将要不断赢下胜仗，总有一天会亲手夺取的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d4877afd28b7bfbef603716261c04bf31346e51bc90bb26de87fbf5ba46c77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
